    "title": "PetPage",
    "description": "PetPage has turned the page to a newer, better, more responsive app to simplify caring for your pet from the palm of your hand.*\r\n\r\nThe PetPage App features easy-to-use, self-serve tools keeping you connected to your\r\nveterinarian and your pet\u2019s health 24/7:\r\n     - Simple registration and login process\r\n     - Set up and receive in-app notifications and reminders\r\n     - Request appointments \u2013 even after hours\r\n     - Request prescription refills anytime, anywhere\r\n     - Share your Pet ID and contact information\r\n     - Easily update your information\r\n\r\n*Your veterinarian must be subscribed to PetPage, and you must have an email address on file with them to register in the app. Have questions? Contact your veterinarian today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "PetPage has turned the page to a newer, better, more responsive app to simplify caring for your pet from the palm of your hand.*<br><br>The PetPage App features easy-to-use, self-serve tools keeping you connected to your<br>veterinarian and your pet\u2019s health 24/7:<br>     - Simple registration and login process<br>     - Set up and receive in-app notifications and reminders<br>     - Request appointments \u2013 even after hours<br>     - Request prescription refills anytime, anywhere<br>     - Share your Pet ID and contact information<br>     - Easily update your information<br><br>*Your veterinarian must be subscribed to PetPage, and you must have an email address on file with them to register in the app. Have questions? Contact your veterinarian today!",
